{
  "slug": "tailwind-design-system",
  "name": "Tailwind Design System",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Design system builder and refactorer for Tailwind CSS + Next.js projects. Audits existing styles, defines semantic color/typography tokens, extracts shared UI components, migrates codebases, and provides ongoing compliance review.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `daily` (Session orientation + work recommendation), `feature-flow` (Full-cycle guide for building a single screen/feature — from scope and planning through execution, review, commits, and documentation), `feature-flow-superpowers` (Superpowers-extended variant of feature-flow), `shimmy-tone` (seungboshim(Shim)의 개인 저술 보이스로 글을 쓴다), `tailwind-design-system` (Design system builder and refactorer for Tailwind CSS + Next.js projects), `worklog` (Post-work documentation ritual)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tailwind-design-system@claude-community` from `seungboshim/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
